  "description": "Each capability owner label (the catalog's \"owner\") mapped to one spec service, none (UI, composition, and program labels own no commands), blocked:OD-1, or per-row, where rows lists the service each row of that label takes. A row whose command owner is a leaf of the capability must take that service (DR-0002 L1).",
